<section class="colophon-section" aria-labelledby="built-with">
<h2 id="built-with">Built with</h2>
<ul>
  <li><a href="https://www.11ty.dev/">Eleventy</a> builds the pages from Markdown files.</li>
  <li><a href="https://pages.github.com/">GitHub Pages</a> hosts the site.</li>
  <li>Text is set in <a href="https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Alegreya+Sans">Alegreya Sans</a>.</li>
